            "deadline": "13 July 2026",
            "deduction": null
          },
          "text": "Hello, thank you for writing to us. We have registered your return request and your refund is due by 13 July 2026. This return keeps the terms of your order. Your next orders will have these return terms, shown before each purchase: refund within the legal time limit, not instant. These terms take into account your previous returns. For any questions, just reply to this message. You matter to us.\n\nYou can always withdraw from your purchase within 14 days of delivery without giving any reason. We will refund you within 14 days of your notice, once we receive the items or proof that you have sent them back."
